hips]].\\n- Screen readers hear the change: the list is `aria-live=\\\"polite\\\"`.\\n\\n## From query to chips\\n\\n```mermaid\\nflowchart LR\\n  Q[Query text] --> P[parseQuery] --> C[Chips]\\n```\\n\\n| Filter     | Example               |\\n| ---------- | --------------------- |\\n| Region     | `region:alps`         |\\n| Difficulty | `difficulty:moderate` |\\n\\nRelated: [[Trail data]] and [[Accessibility checklist]].\\n\",\"plain\":false,\"vault\":{\"id\":\"vault_7614650f91e64ada973ed684\",\"path\":\"Search filters.md\"}}"},{"method":"POST","url":"/api/service/status","body":"{}","status":200,"type":"application/json; charset=utf-8","text":"{\"service\":\"med\",\"version\":1,\"pid\":29760,\"home\":\"/work/home\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"vault_7614650f91e64ada973ed684\",\"kind\":\"vault\",\"path\":\"/work/trailhead-notes\",\"identity\":\"16777234:143377427:1791641962649.8782\",\"name\":\"trailhead-notes\",\"index\":{\"state\":\"ready\",\"revision\":1,\"result\":{\"files\":4,\"notes\":4,\"failedNotes\":0,\"links\":6,\"embeds\":0,\"unresolved\":0,\"ambiguous\":0,\"parsed\":4,\"readBytes\":957,\"changed\":4,\"removed\":0,\"failures\":0,\"resolvedLinks\":6,\"timings\":{\"enumerateMs\":0.9580829999999878,\"readMs\":0.9342090000000667,\"parseMs\":8.02054099999998,\"updateMs\":9.184582999999975,\"resolveAndCommitMs\":1.6622920000000363,\"totalMs\":11.806375000000003}}},\"watching\":true}]}"},{"method":"POST","url":"/api/service/status","body":"{}","status":200,"type":"application/json; charset=utf-8","text":"{\"service\":\"med\",\"version\":1,\"pid\":29760,\"home\":\"/work/home\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"vault_7614650f91e64ada973ed684\",\"kind\":\"vault\",\"path\":\"/work/trailhead-notes\",\"identity\":\"16777234:143377427:1791641962649.8782\",\"name\":\"trailhead-notes\",\"index\":{\"state\":\"ready\",\"revision\":1,\"result\":{\"files\":4,\"notes\":4,\"failedNotes\":0,\"links\":6,\"embeds\":0,\"unresolved\":0,\"ambiguous\":0,\"parsed\":4,\"readBytes\":957,\"changed\":4,